do SteamManager.unlock_achievement("WELCOME_TO_RADIOTEXT")
do GameState.npc_goes_offline(GameState.sky, 500)
while sky.online == false
	=>< offline 

do GameState.npc_goes_online(sky)


Sky: I'm back for a short time.[next=auto]
Sky: How was it? Were you able to adapt to Radiotext?
- kind of
	Sky: You seemed as a sharp one :) guess I was right.
	- you were right?
		Sky: We had a little bet inside. Whether you'd catch up to speed or not.[wait=0.7] I played on you.[next=auto]
		- thanks
			Sky: I should thank you. you basically got me a brand new [url=FreeDictionaryGlass][u]glass[/u][/url].[next=auto]
		- fuck you
			Sky: Sorry.[do sky.romance -= 1][next=auto]
	- what is next
- not yet
	Sky: No need to rush. you'll get used to it.
	- what is next

Sky: I will ask you whether you want to join the [b]Syndicate[/b] or not.[next=auto]
Sky: [do! Global.demo_ending_explosion()][shake]Shit[/shake][wait=10] so it begins.
- [shake]what the fuck was that?[/shake]
- [erase time=0.0, alpha=0.0]wtf[/erase]
- [erase time=0.0, alpha=0.0]wtf was that[/erase]
Sky: That was the dropping tower.[set GameState.tower_blown_up = true][wait=2][next=auto]
Sky: There is no going back now.[next=auto]
Sky: Have you made your decision?[next=auto]
- [shake]I decided[/shake]
	Sky: I'm hoping it is against the falling tyrants.
	- [shake]I want in[/shake]
		do GameState.syndicate_left += 1
		Sky: Welcome then[wait=1] rookie.[next=auto]
		Sky: It is fun, you're gonna love it.[next=auto]
	- [shake]not interested[/shake]
		Sky: I'll be damned.[wait=1] really thought you were like me.[next=auto]
		Sky: Sick and tired of the constant clouds carrying poisonous lead and [url=FreeDictionaryPFAS][u]PFAS[/u][/url].[wait=0.7] pollution so thick you can't even see the horizon anymore.[next=auto]
		Sky: Income inequality all time high while the new generations live shorter than the previous ones. come on man![wait=1] are we gonna live out of our short and miserable lives without fighting back.[next=auto]
		Sky: Are you sure this is your definitive answer?
		- [shake]yes I am out[/shake]
			Sky: Okay.[wait=2][next=auto]
			Sky: I am not gonna preach it to the choir.[wait=1] leaving now.[next=auto]
			set GameState.player_in_syndicate = 3
			=> player_out
		- [shake]no I want in[/shake]
			Sky: [wait=1]Thank you.[wait=1] for a moment I thought I lost you there.[next=auto]
			Sky: Whew[wait=1], welcome then[wait=1] rookie.[next=auto]
			Sky: It is fun, you're gonna love it.[next=auto]
- [shake]need more time[/shake] [if GameState.casey.var_2 > 0 or GameState.arkhos_left > 0]
	Sky: Understood.[next=auto]
	Sky: Wishing you happy freq hunting. hoping that next time you are back, you will join the fight against the tyrants.[next=auto]
	set GameState.player_in_syndicate = 2
	=> player_out

~ first_task
do GameState.syndicate_left += 1
set GameState.player_in_syndicate = 1
do save_from_dialogue("Sky", 7)
~ save_point_7
set GameState.current_act = 2
do! Global.create_custom_line("Terminal", str(second_act.size()) + " new frequencies acquired.")
do! Global.create_custom_line("Terminal", "Connection pool updated.")
do Global.returning_message("Terminal", "awaiting_command") # 30 for awaiting_commands title
Sky: I believe you already passed the tests Flynn gave you.
- Yes I did
	Sky: Well done [if GameState.sky.romance > 0 and GameState.player_name != ""]{{GameState.player_name}}[/if][if GameState.sky.romance > 0 and GameState.player_name == ""]rookie[/if][next=auto]
- Not yet
	Sky: Gotta catch up [if GameState.sky.romance > 0 and GameState.player_name != ""]{{GameState.player_name}}[/if][if GameState.sky.romance > 0 and GameState.player_name == ""]rookie[/if] you're falling behind.[next=auto]
# Sky: There seems to be an issue.[wait=1] it is not clear right now but once it is I'll let you know. till then,
Sky: Since you no longer have a job to do I'll give you something to entertain yourself with.[next=auto]
Sky: Some of the [url=FreeDictionaryInternet-people][u]internet-people[/u][/url] been leading people here,[wait=0.5] advertising it as surveillance free texting.[next=auto]
Sky: But after people install radiotext they start wandering aimless.[wait=0.5] I want you to give a reason to them.[next=auto]
Sky: Till I ping you again, keep connecting to available frequencies and convince people to stand up. mention [b]The Syndicate[/b], we can always use more people for [i]the protest[/i].
- wasnt this secret
	Sky: We are not going to tell them everything I told you.[wait=1] but in order to revolt, we need the people to organize in masses.[next=auto]
- do I test them myself
	do GameState.sky.relation += 1
	Sky: Hahah, no.[wait=0.5] you don't need to bother with that. Flynn got it covered.[next=auto]
- spread propaganda? [if GameState.cop_right > 1]
	Sky: The truth.[wait=1] which, people are crushed under[wait=0.5] without knowing it[next=auto]
	Sky: How would you feel if the reality was hidden from you?[wait=1] if your workplace slowly turned into a rickety robo shack uninformed?[next=auto]
	Sky: The bad ones been using it from the beginning of time.[wait=0.5] why can't we as well?
	Sky: People will always side with the system unless you tell them[wait=1], show them.
	- I understand
		Sky: Thank you.[wait=0.5] I want people to breathe fresh air[wait=0.5] not toxic waste.[next=auto]
	- Okay I will do it
		Sky: Thank you.[next=auto]
	- sound awful a lot like arkhos [if GameState.trix_var_3 > 0]
		=>< ARKHOS
	Sky: I hope you see why we are doing this.[next=auto]

Sky: Just ask them whether they want to [i]join Syndicate[/i], most people find us cool.[next=auto]
Sky: Ask their TUF. [set syndicate_recruiting = true ]It is how we add them to the notification channel for [i]the protest[/i].[next=auto]
Sky: There is one more issue I need to tell you[wait=1.0], we suspect there is an [url=FreeDictionaryundercover][u]undercover[/u][/url] inside the waves.[next=auto]
Sky: However it is not clear now[wait=0.5] and I don't want a newbie going around accusing people.[next=auto]
Sky: I'll let you know once we are certain.[next=auto]
#Sky: Just let me know next time if you talk to anyone suspicious.[next=auto]
Sky: For now just focus on recruiting people.[wait=1.0] see you later rookie.[do Global.auto_offline_wait("Sky", 180, "see you")]
- see you
- your picture is cool [if plugin_bitmap_installed == 2]
	do GameState.sky.romance += 1
	Sky: Huh[wait=1], oh that. thank you.[next=auto]
	Sky: It has been some time since I've done that[wait=0.5], yeah.[wait=1] thanks.[next=auto]
	if GameState.sky.romance > 1:
		Sky: You know[wait=1] you were cute too[wait=1] back in the alley, when we met.[next=auto]





~ player_out


do save_from_dialogue("Sky", 8)
~ save_point_8
do SteamManager.unlock_achievement("CHEAT_DEATH")
if GameState.current_act == 1:
	set GameState.current_act = 2 # MENTAL NOTE
	do! Global.create_custom_line("Terminal", str(second_act.size()) + " new frequencies acquired.")
	do! Global.create_custom_line("Terminal", "Connection pool updated.")
	do Global.returning_message("Terminal", "awaiting_command") # 30 for awaiting_commands title

if player_in_syndicate == 1:
	do GameState.npc_goes_offline(GameState.sky, 950)
	while sky.online == false
		=>< offline 

	do GameState.npc_goes_online(sky)

else:
	do GameState.npc_goes_offline(GameState.sky, 700)
	while sky.online == false
		=>< offline 

	do GameState.npc_goes_online(sky)


if player_in_syndicate == 3:
	=> sky_lures_player
elif player_in_syndicate == 2:
	=> sky_tries_to_convince
else: 
	=> sky_continues

